 R←Test_10(stopFlag batchFlag);fns;MyFns;⎕TRAP;home;rc;en;more
⍝ Test "HandleError.Process": fires up a thread. Should still save an error WS.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

⍝ Preconditions...
 ⎕TRAP←(405 'E' '406 ##.HandleError.Process  ''''')(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 home←GetDefaultErrorFolder
 {}FilesAndDirs.RmDir home
 {}'CREATE!'FilesAndDirs.CheckPath home

 fns←⍎⎕FX'MyFns dummy' '⎕dl .1 ⋄ →1'
 fns&1
 :Trap 406
     {⎕SIGNAL ⍵}405
     →T.GoToTidyUp 1
 :EndTrap

 →T.GoToTidyUp 406≠⎕EN
 →T.GoToTidyUp 3≠≢⊃FilesAndDirs.Dir home,'\'   ⍝ DCF & HTML & DWS
 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 (rc en more)←FilesAndDirs.RmDir home

⍝Done
